---
interface Props {
  currentLang?: 'id' | 'ja';
}

const { currentLang = 'id' } = Astro.props;
---

<footer class="bg-brand-charcoal text-white pt-16 pb-12 border-t border-brand-charcoal">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 pb-16 border-b border-white/10">
      
      <!-- Brand & Mission Column -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 space-y-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded bg-brand-vermilion flex items-center justify-center text-white font-heading font-extrabold text-lg">
            S
          </div>
          <span class="font-heading font-extrabold text-xl tracking-tight text-white">
            LPK SAINDO
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm font-body text-gray-400 leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          {currentLang === 'ja'
            ? 'LPK Saindoは、インドネシアの有望な若者を育成し、日本の優良企業および監理団体へ送り出す認定教育機関です。'
            : 'Lembaga Pelatihan Kerja resmi ke Jepang berizin SO & Kemnaker. Membina generasi muda berkarakter, mahir berbahasa Jepang, dan memiliki keahlian vokasi terstandar industri.'}
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2 text-xs text-gray-400 space-y-1">
          <p><span class="text-gray-300 font-semibold">Izin Resmi SO:</span> KEMNAKER RI No. 2/XXX/HK.01/2022</p>
          <p><span class="text-gray-300 font-semibold">VIN Lembaga:</span> 2209320401</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Navigation -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 space-y-4">
        <h4 class="font-heading font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-sand">
          {currentLang === 'ja' ? 'ナビゲーション' : 'Menu Navigasi'}
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm font-body text-gray-400">
          <li><a href={currentLang === 'ja' ? '/ja' : '/'} class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Beranda</a></li>
          <li><a href={currentLang === 'ja' ? '/ja/about' : '/about'} class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Tentang Kami</a></li>
          <li><a href={currentLang === 'ja' ? '/ja/programs' : '/programs'} class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Program Pelatihan</a></li>
          <li><a href={currentLang === 'ja' ? '/ja/gallery' : '/gallery'} class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Galeri Dokumentasi</a></li>
          <li><a href={currentLang === 'ja' ? '/ja/blog' : '/blog'} class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Warta & Artikel</a></li>
          <li><a href={currentLang === 'ja' ? '/ja/contact' : '/contact'} class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Kontak & Lokasi</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Contact Info -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4 space-y-4">
        <h4 class="font-heading font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-sand">
          {currentLang === 'ja' ? '連絡先' : 'Kantor & Pusat Pelatihan'}
        </h4>
        <p class="text-sm font-body text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          Jl. Pendidikan Kejuruan No. 88, Jawa Barat, Indonesia
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-400 font-body">
          <p class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-brand-vermilion">WA:</span>
            <a href="https://wa.me/628123456789" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">+62 812-3456-7890</a>
          </p>
          <p class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-brand-vermilion">Email:</span>
            <a href="mailto:info@lpksaindo.com" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">info@lpksaindo.com</a>
          </p>
          <p class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-brand-vermilion">Jam:</span>
            <span>Senin - Sabtu: 08.00 - 17.00 WIB</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Copyright -->
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs text-gray-400 gap-4">
      <p>© 2026 LPK Saindo. All Rights Reserved. Japanese Corporate Minimalist Architecture.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
        <a href="/admin/login" class="hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors">Portal Admin</a>
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors">Kebijakan Privasi</a>
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors">Syarat & Ketentuan</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
